{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40464","headline":"罗浮山下书逸人壁 · 曹松","name":"罗浮山下书逸人壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海上亭台山下烟，买时幽邃不争钱。\n莫言白日催华发，自有丹砂驻少年。\n渔钓未归深竹里，琴壶犹恋落花边。\n可中更践无人境，知是罗浮第几天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40464.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40464","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}